
---

# 0.29 Create the initial `.gitignore`

This file prevents Git from tracking files that should not be committed.

This is especially important for DevSecOps because accidental secret commits are a real problem.

### FILE: `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# ==========================================
# Operating system files
# ==========================================

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# ==========================================
# Editors and IDEs
# ==========================================

.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ==========================================
# Node.js
# ==========================================

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build output
dist/
build/
coverage/

# ==========================================
# Terraform
# ==========================================

.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Terraform plan files
*.tfplan
*.plan

# ==========================================
# Kubernetes
# ==========================================

*.kubeconfig

# ==========================================
# Security tool output
# ==========================================

trivy-report.*
semgrep-report.*
gitleaks-report.*
checkov-report.*
sbom.*

# ==========================================
# Docker
# ==========================================

.docker/

# ==========================================
# Logs
# ==========================================

*.log
logs/

# ==========================================
# Temporary files
# ==========================================

tmp/
temp/
.cache/

# ==========================================
# Secrets and credentials
# ==========================================

*.pem
*.key
*.crt
credentials
credentials.*
.aws/
.ssh/

# Never commit local secret files
secrets/